WEBVTT

00:11:59.757 --> 00:12:01.884
I can set up an LLC for them

00:12:01.925 --> 00:12:04.136
so that they can co-own
real estate properties,

00:12:04.136 --> 00:12:05.471
pay taxes together,

00:12:05.512 --> 00:12:07.139
purchase a common health insurance

00:12:07.181 --> 00:12:09.349
and have clear
exit strategies if they wish.

00:12:10.225 --> 00:12:15.063
(Applause)

00:12:15.105 --> 00:12:17.316
And if people trust each other enough

00:12:17.357 --> 00:12:21.028
to pool their financial fortune
and want to pay taxes together,

00:12:21.069 --> 00:12:23.614
it shouldn't matter
whether they're business partners,

00:12:23.655 --> 00:12:25.365
siblings or romantic partners.

00:12:25.365 --> 00:12:27.075
All of those families are valid.

00:12:27.576 --> 00:12:28.827
(Applause)

00:12:28.869 --> 00:12:29.995
Thank you.